{
  "$schema": "../data/component-spec-schema.json",
  "component": "gallery",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "status": "stable",
  "layer": "organism",
  "tags": [
    "interactive",
    "display",
    "carousel",
    "hero",
    "media"
  ],
  "anatomy": {
    "rootElement": ".nc-gallery",
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "track",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__track",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Flex-Container fuer Slides. Horizontal via translate3d animiert."
      },
      {
        "name": "slide",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__slide",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Einzelner Slide (role=tabpanel, id). 100% Breite, flex-shrink:0. Enthaelt BG + Content. Verborgene Slides sind inert (neo-behaviors gallery)."
      },
      {
        "name": "slide-bg",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__slide-bg",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Hintergrundbild-Container. Absolute positioniert, object-fit:cover."
      },
      {
        "name": "slide-overlay",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__slide-overlay",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Gradient-Overlay fuer Textkontrast. Richtung + Opazitaet via Tokens."
      },
      {
        "name": "slide-content",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__slide-content",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Content-Wrapper: Logo, Tag, Titel, Beschreibung, Actions."
      },
      {
        "name": "controls",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__controls",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Container fuer Prev/Next Paddle-Buttons. Absolute overlay."
      },
      {
        "name": "paddle",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__paddle",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Prev/Next Pfeil-Button. Runder Button mit Pfeil-Icon."
      },
      {
        "name": "nav",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__nav",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Punkte-Leiste. role=tablist. Position unten zentriert."
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-dot",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__nav-dot",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Einzelner Punkt. role=tab, aria-selected, aria-controls auf den Slide, wandernder tabindex."
      },
      {
        "name": "autoplay",
        "selector": ".nc-gallery__autoplay",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Pause-/Abspiel-Knopf (einzige Quelle des Autoplay-Zustands): data-playing=\"true|false\" waehlt das Symbol, aria-label wechselt „Galerie pausieren“/„Galerie abspielen“. Bei autoplay off und prefers-reduced-motion [hidden]."
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Website-only: die Paddles tragen neben .nc-gallery__paddle die Haken .nc-gallery__paddle--prev/--next (Markup der Website, data-gallery-prev/-next) — kein CSS im DS.",
      "Root: position:relative, overflow:hidden, width:100%, height via --nc-gallery-height.",
      "Track: display:flex, transform:translate3d(-Nx100%, 0, 0). will-change:transform.",
      "Slide-BG: position:absolute, inset:0. img mit object-fit:cover.",
      "Overlay: linear-gradient(direction, start, end). pointer-events:none.",
      "Content: position:relative, z-index:2. Flex-Column mit gap.",
      "Paddles: button mit aria-label ('Vorheriger Slide', 'Naechster Slide').",
      "Per-Slide-Theme: data-slide-theme='light|dark' auf .nc-gallery__slide.",
      "Animation: Slide = translate3d auf Track. Fade = opacity auf Slides (position:absolute).",
      "prefers-reduced-motion: Autoplay deaktiviert, Transitionen entfernt.",
      "Slide: flex:0 0 100%, position:relative. Aktiver Slide .is-active; die anderen inert und aria-hidden (neo-behaviors gallery).",
      "Nav: role='tablist'. Punkte: button[role='tab'], aria-selected='true|false', aria-controls (Slide-id), wandernder tabindex.",
      "Autoplay: button.nc-gallery__autoplay mit data-playing und wechselndem aria-label ('Galerie pausieren' / 'Galerie abspielen'); Symbole .nc-gallery__autoplay-pause/-play folgen data-playing (CSS).",
      "Keyboard: Pfeil links/rechts blaettert (auf Punkten: waehlt und fokussiert, rundum; Pos1/Ende), Enter/Space aktivieren, Escape haelt den Autoplay an. Im Inhalt eines Slides blaettern die Pfeile nicht (der Fokus laege sonst in einem verborgenen Slide).",
      "Verhalten (Plan v4, Phase 2, 12.10.2026): neo-behaviors gallery bindet an fertiges Markup; Slides und Punkte rendert seit Plan v4, Phase 7 das Twig (vorher neoGallery aus JSON)."
    ]
  },
  "api": null,
  "variants": {
    "animation": {
      "label": "Animation",
      "description": "Uebergangs-Animation — slide (translate3d), fade (opacity), none (sofort)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "slide",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "slide"
        },
        {
          "value": "fade",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--fade",
          "default": false,
          "label": "fade"
        },
        {
          "value": "none",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--no-anim",
          "default": false,
          "label": "none"
        }
      ]
    },
    "navStyle": {
      "label": "Nav Style",
      "description": "Navigations-Indikator — dots (Punkte), lines (Balken), thumbnails (Mini-Bilder)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "dots",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "dots"
        },
        {
          "value": "lines",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--lines",
          "default": false,
          "label": "lines"
        },
        {
          "value": "thumbnails",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--thumbnails",
          "default": false,
          "label": "thumbnails"
        }
      ]
    },
    "height": {
      "label": "Height",
      "description": "Slide-Hoehe — viewport (100dvh), fixed (500-700px), aspect (16:9)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "viewport",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "viewport"
        },
        {
          "value": "fixed",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--fixed",
          "default": false,
          "label": "fixed"
        },
        {
          "value": "aspect",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--aspect",
          "default": false,
          "label": "aspect"
        }
      ]
    },
    "contentAlign": {
      "label": "Content Align",
      "description": "Content-Ausrichtung — start (links), center (zentriert), end (rechts)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "start",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "start"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--center",
          "default": false,
          "label": "center"
        },
        {
          "value": "end",
          "cssModifier": "nc-gallery--end",
          "default": false,
          "label": "end"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "focus-visible",
      "playing",
      "paused",
      "stopped"
    ],
    "interactive": true,
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "effects": [],
